WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.510
Here I go!

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.060
Yes!

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.060
Okay, great job!

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.370
That's the way!

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.190
Okay!

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.190
Tenma!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.000
Tenma, me next!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.450
Hey, no fair, it's my turn!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.750
Now, now, class. Stay in line.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.630
But he won't!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.540
Hey, I was supposed to go before you!

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:35.840
Now, everyone! Listen to Hanabayashi-sensei and form a single straight line!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.160
Okay!

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.840
Three months have passed since the Holy Road championship.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.660
Currently, I'm traveling throughout the nation teaching soccer to kids.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:51.080
It's part of the soccer education program that Gouenji-san set up.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.560
Time flies so fast.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.830
Today is the last day you'll be teaching us.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:01.730
Yes, it went by rather quickly.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.190
Those kids have gotten so good that I hardly recognize them.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:08.410
And they all look so alive.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:10.130
Thank you.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.710
It's all because of you, Tenma-kun.

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:15.330
No, not me. It's because of soccer.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.300
Gouenji-san.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:23.160
Soccer has gone back to being a sport that excites people.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:30.880
I'll do my best to make it so that children all over Japan can enjoy playing soccer.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:14.790
It's been so long!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.240
I hope everyone's doing well.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.000
I can't wait to see the soccer club again.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.920
Left field, there it goes!

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:32.090
Huh? The second grounds...

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.840
Well, there's still the soccer building.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.330
Honey, I'm home!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.930
Just kidding!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:02.820
Huh?

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.180
We're in good form today.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.320
Um, excuse me.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.760
Do you know where the soccer club is?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.020
Soccer club?

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:11.710
Yes.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.260
Huh?

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:16.880
Well, this is the soccer building isn't it? Strictly for the soccer club.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:26.230
At this time, I never imagined I'd get a reply like that to my casual question.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.270
What are you talking about?

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.960
There is no soccer club here.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.120
Not here?

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.030
Did they change locations?

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.800
No.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.230
Then where is the soccer club?

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:39.900
Listen...

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.880
Hey, you could at least tell me!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.360
Seriously, look...

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.360
Gather up!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.010
You guys, get over here!

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.610
That guy's a weirdo, huh?

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.840
They're all terrible.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.970
If they relocated the clubroom, they could have at least called me and said so.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.060
Captain Shindou!

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.830
Captain!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.520
Thank goodness!

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.940
I was getting nervous since I didn't see anyone.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.160
Captain? Me?

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.510
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.430
I'm the captain now.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:28.710
I'm sorry. But I was wondering where everyone else was.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:29.920
Everyone else?

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:30.920
Yes.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.120
They don't seem to be practicing anywhere...

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.630
And it seems the soccer clubroom even changed locations.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.470
What happened?

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:41.230
Soccer clubroom?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.580
What are you talking about?

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.800
The soccer clubroom couldn't have changed locations.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.970
This school has no soccer club to begin with.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:53.970
Yeah, right.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.650
That's really funny.

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:59.190
Is this some kind of school prank?

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.680
Please, enough joking-

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:03.170
I don't know who misinformed you, but...

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.170
I'm Shindou Takuto from the music club.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.340
You're joking... right?

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.910
Are you a transfer student?

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:17.700
Unfortunately, if you wanted to join a soccer club, you'll have to go to a different school.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.810
Goodbye.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.300
What's going on?

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:26.300
There's no way Raimon doesn't have a soccer club.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.220
Was he just teasing me?

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.410
Sangoku-senpai!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:33.250
It's been a while!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.880
Shindou-senpai is being mean!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.850
Did something happen to the soccer club?

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.400
From what I can see, you're a first-year, right?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.320
We don't have a soccer club.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.480
If you want to join a sports team, come to sumo!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.000
I'll let you in anytime!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.020
Dosukoi!

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:52.080
S-Sangoku-senpai?

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:52.350
C'mon, c'mon!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:56.000
Hey, first-year! Soccer isn't the only sport out there!

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.300
Rugby's great, too!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.630
Dash Train!

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:04.790
Sorry, I'm not interested in soccer.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:07.740
I'm busy.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.830
I don't know any soccer.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.860
Who are you?

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.540
Just what is going on?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.790
If it's a joke, they're going way too overboard for just one person.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.120
Shinsuke!

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.870
Shinsuke!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.900
Hey, what's going on-

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.550
You're a first-year, aren't you?

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:37.640
I'm Nishizono Shinsuke from the ping-pong club!

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.290
Want to join?

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.860
Tenma!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:43.610
Hey, you!

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:44.910
Aoi!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.050
You recognize me?!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.730
Of course I do.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:52.350
But don't even think about joining the ping-pong club.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.460
After all, we're...

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.790
The soccer club!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.980
We're the calligraphy club, right?

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:03.470
C-Calligraphy?!

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.860
What is going on here?

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.370
It isn't just the soccer club that's gone.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:15.320
Everyone's forgotten about soccer.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.540
Why?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:22.110
They all loved soccer so much...

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:25.760
How could they forget soccer just like that?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.040
Has soccer disappeared?

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.060
No.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.060
Soccer has not disappeared.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:38.310
The elimination of soccer is still incomplete.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:39.830
Who are you?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:40.940
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:44.430
As of now, I will eliminate soccer from you too.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.460
Eliminate soccer?

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:51.030
I am Alpha.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.410
My mission is to eliminate soccer.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:58.660
The only remaining traces of it left are in you, Matsukaze Tenma.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.470
Remaining traces?

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.390
Me?

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:13.670
Are you the reason why Raimon's gone all weird?

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:14.780
That's right.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.410
I'll never let you erase soccer!

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.490
Turn everyone back to normal!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.540
Give soccer back!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:23.520
No.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.790
What we must do is the exact opposite.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.790
The total annihilation of soccer.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.200
That's...

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:32.040
I won't let you!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:34.610
You cannot resist me.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.050
Time Warp Mode.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:44.510
Hey-

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.180
Where am I?

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.080
Could this place be...?

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.080
No way...

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.080
Mom!

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.110
That's me!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.110
Sasuke!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.110
I'm in the past...

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:22.630
Is this a dream?

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:25.090
Am I dreaming?

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:29.170
No, this isn't a dream!

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.550
You don't have to understand it.

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:35.070
Just take in the reality before you as it unfolds.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:39.560
As of now, I will erase the meaning that soccer has for you.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:40.620
Tenma!

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:44.130
That's right.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:47.890
This is when I first met soccer.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:52.930
I grew to love soccer because a soccer ball saved my life.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:54.280
Strike Mode.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.740
Tenma!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.720
Tenma!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:10.920
Modification of the Interruption point completed.

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:14.840
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:20.300
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:25.960
Don't worry.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.710
You haven't died.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:31.660
You only need a month for your injuries to fully heal.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:33.370
What?

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:37.990
But now, the meaning that soccer has for you is gone.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.160
What are you-

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:43.490
Huh?

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.780
Soccer is...

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:45.680
I...

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.040
The extraneous nonsense is vanishing from your memory.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.960
That's all.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:57.530
Mission complete.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:58.770
Wait.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:02.180
I... really like soccer!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:03.560
What?

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:07.320
I love soccer!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:09.780
I love it, and it's important to me!

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:14.410
You've got to protect what you love and what's important to you, no matter what!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.380
So I will never forget soccer!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.090
You can't take soccer from me!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.750
What is the meaning of this?

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:37.780
Matsukaze Tenma has not changed even when the Interruption point has been modified.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:41.890
He is willing himself to fight against the altered reality.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:45.250
Ludicrous! Is that even possible?

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.300
This is rather interesting.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.580
Let us continue to observe him a while longer.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.310
Yes.

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:55.630
Then it shall be done.

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:02.860
A new method has been proposed to conclude this matter.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.640
I will now change locations.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:05.810
Move Mode.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:15.920
This is...

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.880
The appropriate place, wouldn't you agree?

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.500
You should be pleased.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:32.430
Here, you will get to play the soccer you so love against us.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.430
You guys are soccer players?

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.940
Nothing as lower dimensional as that.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:42.890
We are Route Agents authorized to intervene with time.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:50.820
By correcting time routes, it is our mission to create a route where soccer is no longer a part of this world.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.770
A route where soccer is gone?

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:55.310
Yes.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.580
Strike Mode.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.750
We will eliminate soccer!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.370
I won't let that happen!

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.080
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:15.090
Your Avatar is of a lower dimension.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.690
That was nothing...

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:28.590
Oh, really?

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.850
Now, how did that make you feel?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.720
Did you feel how frightening soccer can be?

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.700
Soccer brings pain, hurt, burden, agony, evil...

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.940
Soccer brings pain, hurt, burden, agony, evil...

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.080
Soccer brings pain, hurt, burden, agony, evil...

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.240
Soccer brings pain, hurt, burden, agony, evil...

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:07.460
Soccer brings pain, hurt, burden, agony, evil...

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:09.080
It is unnecessary.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.300
Yes.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.190
Soccer is unnecessary.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.300
Soccer is...

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:30.560
Soccer is necessary.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:31.910
Right?

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.430
Those are your words, Tenma.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:36.030
Who are you?

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.270
My name is Fei Rune.

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:43.740
Just like Tenma here, I need soccer.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:47.010
Do you enjoy ganging up on one person?

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.010
Then let's make this a real contest.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.200
Contest?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.260
How so?

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.540
How about this?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.870
Very well.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:12.170
Honey, it looks like we'll be having a lot of customers today!

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.170
Okay! Things are about to get busy!

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:23.230
Hey, honey, it's time to-

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:23.910
Huh?

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:25.100
Oh dear...

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:28.830
It's time for us to open, where did he go off to?

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:36.870
Why am I holding a mic?!

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.410
Please see to it.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.220
Okay, just leave it to me!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.250
I've inputted the players' data into this man's brain.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:49.260
I've heard that commentary is essential in a soccer match.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:55.560
We have registered our team name as Protocol Omega.

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.050
What is yours?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.050
Oh, I see...

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:02.670
We don't have a name yet since we're an improvised team.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:05.650
We're...

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.440
Let's go with Tenmas!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:11.010
T-Tenmas?

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:13.600
Since we're Tenma's team, we're Tenmas!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.440
Perfect, right?

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.610
Here.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:17.930
What's that for?

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.040
You're the captain, aren't you?

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:27.540
Now, the match between Protocol Omega and Tenmas is about to begin!

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:40.060
Amazing! They're so speedy that I can't even follow the ball!

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:42.170
W-What is this?

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:45.250
Don't worry, your eyes just aren't used to the speed yet.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.230
C'mon, let's fight!

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.770
Tenmas steal the ball!

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:56.860
Wow!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.190
Bouncer Rabbit!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.520
Keeper Command 03!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.950
<Boom Shout>

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.340
Goalkeeper Zanou blocks it!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.800
Now, the game resumes!

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:22.990
What a fierce back-and-forth!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.240
Defense!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.000
Okay!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.330
Fractal House!

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.010
Shoot Command 01!

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:42.360
<Spinning Trans-am>

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.880
Alpha shoots!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:46.010
Will goalkeeper Machos be able to stop it?!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.590
Excellent Breast!

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.270
He stops it!

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.350
What a battle! It involves the whole body and mind!

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.540
Not bad.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.330
We won't let you score.

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.550
Both teams are still at 0-0!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.010
It's about time.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.070
Rampage to your heart's content, sir.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.750
Ruler of the Skies, Phoenix!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:27.750
Armed!

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:43.500
W-What's this?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.770
Alpha's body has changed!

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:48.230
More like, it's transformed!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.180
Now, here I go.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.560
With his transformed body, Alpha tears through the defense!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:59.300
Goal!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.760
The first point goes to Protocol Omega!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:05.030
It was scored by Alpha who appears bedecked in beautiful clothing.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.630
What was that?

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:14.610
His appearance changed by fusing himself with his own Avatar and wearing it like armor.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:17.590
That's Avatar Armed.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.910
He wore his Avatar like armor?

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:27.620
It's time-sensitive, but it allows him to expend a lot more power than if he controlled his Avatar from a distance.

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.220
That's possible?

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:39.120
They're more interested in hurting us than scoring goals!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.020
It's tough holding up nine Dupli...

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:48.260
What should we do?

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.260
Don't worry, it's almost time.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.540
Oh, yeah, the first half will be over soon.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.300
There's that, but I'm waiting for something else.

00:20:58.220 --> 00:20:59.300
He's coming.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:02.300
3... 2... 1...

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.310
That's...

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.370
Tenma-kun! Greetings!

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.370
A bear?

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.370
Now I know I'm dreaming.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:23.810
And so, our newest ordeal began.

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:27.110
Who could have guessed how it would end up?

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:58.360
In order to take back the history of Raimon's soccer club, I go to meet him!

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:01.280
Yep, the day the soccer club was revived!

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:03.660
Next, Tenma Leaps Through Time!

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:05.550
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:18.890
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:26.550
You've got to protect what's important to you, no matter what!

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:27.230
That's all!
